{"suttaId":"pv45","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Pv","vriCode":"s0507m.mul","paras":[2533,2566],"vripara":"782"},"segments":{"pv45:0.3":"Gaṇapetavatthu","pv45:1.1":"“Naggā dubbaṇṇarūpāttha, kisā dhamanisanthatā;","pv45:1.3":"Upphāsulikā [uppāsuḷikā (ka.)] kisikā, ke nu tumhettha mārisā”ti.","pv45:2.1":"“Mayaṃ bhadante petāmhā, duggatā yamalokikā;","pv45:2.3":"Pāpakammaṃ karitvāna, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","pv45:3.1":"“Kiṃ nu kāyena vācāya, manasā dukkaṭaṃ kataṃ;","pv45:3.3":"Kissa kammavipākena, petalokaṃ ito gatā”ti.","pv45:4.1":"“Anāvaṭesu titthesu, vicinimhaddhamāsakaṃ;","pv45:4.3":"Santesu deyyadhammesu, dīpaṃ nākamha attano.","pv45:5.1":"“Nadiṃ upema tasitā, rittakā parivattati;","pv45:5.3":"Chāyaṃ upema uṇhesu, ātapo parivattati.","pv45:6.1":"“Aggivaṇṇo ca no vāto, ḍahanto upavāyati;","pv45:6.3":"Etañca bhante arahāma, aññañca pāpakaṃ tato.","pv45:7.1":"“Api yojanāni [adhiyojanāni (sī. ka.)] gacchāma, chātā āhāragedhino;","pv45:7.3":"Aladdhāva nivattāma, aho no appapuññatā.","pv45:8.1":"“Chātā pamucchitā bhantā, bhūmiyaṃ paṭisumbhitā;","pv45:8.3":"Uttānā paṭikirāma, avakujjā patāmase.","pv45:9.1":"“Te ca tattheva patitā [tattha papahitā (ka.)], bhūmiyaṃ paṭisumbhitā;","pv45:9.3":"Uraṃ sīsañca ghaṭṭema, aho no appapuññatā.","pv45:10.1":"“Etañca bhante arahāma, aññañca pāpakaṃ tato;","pv45:10.3":"Santesu deyyadhammesu, dīpaṃ nākamha attano.","pv45:11.1":"“Te hi nūna ito gantvā, yoniṃ laddhāna mānusiṃ;","pv45:11.3":"Vadaññū sīlasampannā, kāhāma kusalaṃ bahun”ti.","pv45:12.1":"Gaṇapetavatthu dasamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Pv-a","bookName":"Petavatthu-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0507a.att","from":3031,"to":3068,"paras":[{"para":3031,"vripara":null,"refs":["pv45:1"],"lines":["Gāthāya pucchi.","Tattha <b>dubbaṇṇarūpātthā</b>ti dubbaṇṇasarīrā hotha.","<b>Ke nu tumhetthā</b>ti tumhe ke nu nāma bhavatha.","<b>Mārisā</b>ti te attano sāruppavasena ālapati."],"lineRefs":[["pv45:1"],["pv45:1"],["pv45:1"],["pv45:1"]]},{"para":3032,"vripara":null,"refs":[]